.TH FILE 1 "April 29, 1985"
.AT 3
.SH NAME
file - determine file type
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B file
file ...
.sp
\fBfile -f\fP \fIlist\fP
.SH DESCRIPTION
In the first form \fBfile\fP
performs a series of tests on each file
in an attempt to classify it.
.PP
In the second form \fIlist\fP contains the names of the files to be tested.
.PP
If a file appears to contain ASCII characters
.B file
examines the first 512 bytes
and tries to guess its language.
.SH BUGS
It often makes mistakes.
In particular it often suggests that
command files are C programs.
.PP
Does not recognize Pascal or LISP.
